{
 "about": "The config document, written by Go and read by Python. cloud/internal/panelconfig's test composes each case and must get `document` byte for byte; device/tests/test_config_documents.py feeds `document` to the panel's own parsers and must get `panelReads`. The wire format has one author and one reader, in two languages, and this file is what holds them to each other. A next the panel drops (any field wrong) is never written, so the shared cases carry only the well-formed one and the absent one; the panel's own tests cover the malformed shapes.",
